          "snippet": {
            "line": 251,
            "text": "theorem pressurePair_decomposition (i j : Fin 3) {h g : Space → ℝ}\n    (hg : Integrable g volume) (hhg : MemLp (fun x => h x * g x) (6 / 5) volume)\n    (ψ ψh : ComplexTest) :\n    pressurePair i j g ψh =\n      (∫ x, (h x * g x : ℝ) * rieszTest i j ψ x) + commutatorPair i j h g ψ ψh"
          }
